---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import ComplianceCountdown from '../../components/ComplianceCountdown.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="EU Battery Regulation (EU 2023/1542) Complete Compliance Guide | EU DPP Provider"
  description="In-depth analysis of Regulation (EU) 2023/1542 requirements, Article 77/78 Battery Passport mandates, 2027 enforcement timeline, and technical checklist."
>
  <div class="py-24 md:py-32 bg-stone-50">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 space-y-16">
      
      <!-- Page Header -->
      <div class="space-y-6 text-center">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-medium bg-stone-100 text-stone-700 border border-stone-200">
          Regulatory Knowledge Center
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl font-semibold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">
          EU Battery Regulation (EU 2023/1542): The Definitive Guide
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-stone-500 leading-relaxed font-normal max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          The European Union's Regulation 2023/1542 establishes the world's most rigorous regulatory framework for the design, manufacture, traceability, and recycling of batteries.
        </p>
      </div>

      <ComplianceCountdown />

      <!-- Section: Key Scope and Categories -->
      <div class="bg-white p-8 sm:p-12 rounded-3xl border border-stone-200 shadow-soft space-y-6">
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-stone-900">1. Which Batteries Require a Digital Passport?</h2>
        <p class="text-base text-stone-600 leading-relaxed font-normal">
          Starting <strong>18 February 2027</strong>, Article 77 mandates that each individual battery in the following categories placed on the EU market must be registered with a unique Digital Battery Passport:
        </p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6 pt-4 text-xs">
          <div class="p-6 bg-stone-50 rounded-2xl border border-stone-200">
            <span class="font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm block mb-2">EV Batteries</span>
            <p class="text-stone-500 text-xs leading-relaxed font-normal">Traction batteries used in electric road vehicles (BEV, PHEV, buses, commercial EV trucks).</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6 bg-stone-50 rounded-2xl border border-stone-200">
            <span class="font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm block mb-2">LMT Batteries</span>
            <p class="text-stone-500 text-xs leading-relaxed font-normal">Light Means of Transport batteries used in e-bikes, electric scooters, and light mopeds (&le; 25kg).</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6 bg-stone-50 rounded-2xl border border-stone-200">
            <span class="font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm block mb-2">Industrial Batteries</span>
            <p class="text-stone-500 text-xs leading-relaxed font-normal">All stationary energy storage systems (BESS), telecom backup, and industrial packs with capacity &gt; 2 kWh.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Section: 90+ Mandatory Data Attributes Checklist -->
      <div class="bg-white p-8 sm:p-12 rounded-3xl border border-stone-200 shadow-soft space-y-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-stone-900">2. Core Data Dimensions Mandated by the Regulation</h2>
        <p class="text-base text-stone-600 leading-relaxed font-normal">
          The Battery Passport is structured into four distinct access tiers to protect commercial confidentiality while fulfilling environmental obligations:
        </p>

        <div class="space-y-6 text-xs">
          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-stone-50 border border-stone-200 space-y-2.5">
            <div class="font-bold text-stone-900 text-base flex items-center justify-between">
              <span>Tier A: General Product Information (Public)</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-emerald-800 bg-emerald-50 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-emerald-200">Unrestricted</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-stone-600 text-xs leading-relaxed font-normal">
              Manufacturer identity, registered trademark, manufacturing date & location, battery category & weight, rated capacity, minimum voltage, certified lifecycle Carbon Footprint (PCF) rating, and consumer end-of-life collection guidelines.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-stone-50 border border-stone-200 space-y-2.5">
            <div class="font-bold text-stone-900 text-base flex items-center justify-between">
              <span>Tier B: Compliance & Due Diligence (Authorities)</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-stone-700 bg-stone-200 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full">Authenticated</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-stone-600 text-xs leading-relaxed font-normal">
              EU Declaration of Conformity (DoC), UN 38.3 test results, CE certification documentation, independent third-party audit reports, and OECD-compliant supply chain due diligence reports for Cobalt, Lithium, Nickel, and Natural Graphite.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-stone-50 border border-stone-200 space-y-2.5">
            <div class="font-bold text-stone-900 text-base flex items-center justify-between">
              <span>Tier C: Dismantling & Material Breakdown (Recyclers)</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-amber-800 bg-amber-50 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-amber-200">Legitimate Interest</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-stone-600 text-xs leading-relaxed font-normal">
              Detailed Bill of Materials (BOM) with exact percentage and weight thresholds of critical raw materials, cathode/anode active material chemistry, hazardous substance declarations, and disassembly protocols.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Callout -->
      <div class="p-10 rounded-3xl bg-stone-900 text-white text-center space-y-4">
        <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold text-white">Download the Complete EU Battery Passport Checklist</h3>
        <p class="text-base text-stone-300 max-w-xl mx-auto font-normal leading-relaxed">
          Get our 32-page compliance guide mapping all 90+ required data fields to your existing ERP and MES systems.
        </p>
        <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex px-8 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-white text-stone-900 font-semibold text-sm hover:bg-stone-100 transition-colors">
          Request Compliance Whitepaper &rarr;
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
